# Nothing here is generated: index.html is a shell and the sentences are data, so the files
# in this repo are the source of truth and there is no build output to ignore.

# Local tool state, installed by jcode-workflow-setup / codegraph. Each of these ships its
# own ignore file that excludes its sensitive and runtime files, and those guard files are
# meant to be committed, which is why the directories are not ignored wholesale here:
#   .jcode/.gitignore     config.toml, auth.json, sessions/, logs/
#   .codegraph/.gitignore the 448 KB index database and its daemons
# Run `node check.js` to check the bank, and `node test.js` to render the page and check it.
